<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Tecun Uman</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1524">1524</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Tecún Umán</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Tecun Uman was a K'iche' Maya leader who, according to tradition, was killed fighting the Spanish under <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/pedro-de-alvarado">Pedro de Alvarado</a> near <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quetzaltenango">Quetzaltenango</a> in 1524, in single combat with Alvarado himself. Spanish letters do not name him, and his story comes from later K'iche' documents. He was declared a national hero of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/guatemala">Guatemala</a> in 1960.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/tecun-uman.jpg" alt="Tecun Uman" width="320" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: El Torrito · CC BY 3.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Tecun_Uman.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
<section class="enc-quotes"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Across the Institute</h2><ul><li><blockquote>In 1524 Pedro de Alvarado defeated the K'iche' near Quetzaltenango, where tradition says the hero <b>Tecun Uman</b> fell, then burnt the kings Oxib Keh and Beleheb Tz'i and destroyed Q'umarkaj.</blockquote><a href="/state/kiche-kingdom">K'iche' kingdom</a></li></ul></section>
<section class="enc-where enc-born"><h2 class="enc-section-title">Born and died</h2><p class="enc-born-p">Born in Totonicapán, in what is now <a href="/countries/guatemala">Guatemala</a>. Died in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/quetzaltenango">Quetzaltenango</a>, in what is now <a href="/countries/guatemala">Guatemala</a>. <span class="enc-born-src">Places as Wikidata records them.</span></p><figure class="st-locator enc-loc"><a href="/atlas?at=14.91,-91.36&amp;year=1514" aria-label="Totonicapán on the atlas"><svg class="map map-loc" viewBox="2053 1609 900 540" role="img" aria-label="Map: the birthplace of Tecun Uman"><image href="/maps/world.svg" x="0" y="0" width="10000" height="4393"/><path class="map-dot-halo" d="M2503 1879h0"/><path class="map-dot-me" d="M2503 1879h0"/></svg></a><figcaption>The dot marks the birthplace. <a href="/atlas?at=14.91,-91.36&amp;year=1514">What was here in 1514? &rarr;</a></figcaption></figure></section>
